    keyLesson: 'Isa (AS) teaches us that the miraculous is always within Allah\'s reach. A virgin birth, speaking from the cradle, raising the dead — all by the permission of Allah. And even at the moment of planned execution, Allah protected His Prophet. No one can harm whom Allah protects.'
